values ('ap_chemistry', 3, '3.1', array['3.1', '3.2']::text[], 'vocabulary', 'Noncovalent interactions in large biomolecules', 'In large biomolecules or polymers, noncovalent interactions may occur between different molecules or between different regions of the same large biomolecule. The functionality and properties of such molecules depend strongly on the shape of the molecule, which is largely dictated by noncovalent interactions.', '[]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'published', 'generated-checked; extractor=anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5; batch=ap-chemistry-reference-u2-u3-2026-10-10; candidate=ap_chemistry-u3-r3-002; ced=3.1.A.5 and 3.2.A.7: "noncovalent interactions may occur between different molecules or between different regions of the same large biomolecule"; product-owner-directed correction by the Claude session (David, 2026-10-10): the escalated row was corrected against its own CED evidence and re-checked by both independent checkers and the own-family veto')
