values ('ap_chemistry', 3, '3.8', array['3.8']::text[], 'diagram', 'Particulate representation of a solution', 'A particulate model of a solution communicates its structure and properties by showing the interactions among components and the relative concentrations of components.', '[{"label": "Interactions between components", "meaning": "Drawings that show the interactions among the solute and solvent components."}, {"label": "Concentrations of components", "meaning": "The relative numbers of particles of each component in the solution."}]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'published', 'generated-checked; extractor=anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5; batch=ap-chemistry-reference-u2-u3-2026-10-10; candidate=ap_chemistry-u3-r2-010; ced=3.8.A.1: "Particulate representations of solutions communicate the structure and properties of solutions, by illustration of the relative concentrations of the components in the solution and/or drawin')
